# Build products of src/Makevars' `all:` target -- libzukomp.a among them --
# are ignored by src/.gitignore, whose patterns carry no slash and so match at
# any depth below src/. .Rbuildignore keeps them out of the tarball; that is a
# separate mechanism and neither implies the other.
